# Binary assets must never pass through Git's text handling (line-ending
# conversion / `text` attribute), which corrupts their bytes on checkout and
# clone. The PDF report depends on IRAN Rounded.ttf loading byte-for-byte, so
# marking every binary asset as binary guards fonts, images, archives and the
# favicon from CRLF/EOL mangling on any platform.
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
